{"title":"Freyliner Transporter Upgrade","slug":"Freyliner_Transporter_Upgrade","hero":{"file":"Box_truck.webp","width":400,"height":118},"pageid":4153,"revid":19635,"timestamp":"2025-09-26T18:40:29Z","lastEditor":"Hiper2382","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<p>The <b>Freyliner Transporter Upgrade</b> was added on June 7th of 2025. It adds a box onto pre-existing trailer to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter/\">Freyliner Transporter</a>. This <b>item</b> used to be bought at <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Alan's_Auto/\">Alans Auto</a> for $95,000 (first-release). As of July 2025 (a month later), the price has went down and now costs $25,000.\n</p><p>\nThe box upgrade of Freyliner is the first box vehicle in the game (coming later is the Golf Cart), allowing player to stores without worrying things will get flipped or fly away. The box has door, player are advised to close the door for best storage security while transporting.</p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"65447014a439cfce26daf5026c045971\" data-seq-no=\"0\"><div></div><div><div><div id=\"Box_truck-png\"><a href=\"__BASE__/file/Box_truck.png/\"><noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter\">The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter</span></noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Image not yet archived: The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter\">The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter</span></a></div></div><div>The box upgrade from the Freyliner Transporter</div></div></div>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The door from the box upgrade opened\">The door from the box upgrade opened</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Box_truck_door_(open).png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The door from the box upgrade opened</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The door from the box upgrade closed\">The door from the box upgrade closed</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"__BASE__/file/Box_truck_door_(closed).png/\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The door from the box upgrade closed</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
